id: JUDGE1-C1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: select_judge
target: crates/core/src/select_judge.rs
find: Ok(spec.options.iter().any(|o| o.id == *id))
replace: Ok(spec.options.iter().any(|o| o.id == *id) || true)
expect-fail: choice_rejects_undeclared_option
note: 選択肢の、宣言にあるかの検査を外す（宣言に無い ID を指す規則が受付になる）
